# Cloudflare Pages: every page and file. The app is never shown in another
# site's frame (clickjacking), files are taken as the type they are served
# with, and a link out says only the site it came from (a game's address is
# the only credential for its seats).
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
